SUMMARY:Working in Silence
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nWe have access to an inc
 reasing range of technologies for entertainment and communication. While o
 ur disciplined and thoughtful selection of such external stimuli can be he
 lpful and enriching\, we need to take care to not overindulge in distracti
 on. We need to have a balance with our internal stimuli\, cultivated by ou
 r practice of meditation\, reflection\, and critical thinking\, for us to 
 learn and grow in understanding. Choosing at times to work in silence has 
 just such a restorative and tonic effect. Join Hugh McCague as we continue
  to explore Rosicrucian laws and principles and their creative expression 
 and application for the mastery of life\, harmonious living\, and service.
 \n\n**Please RSVP to access log-in information. Click ATTEND ONLINE below.
 **
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amorc-santa-rosa-pronaos/events/31547
 7648/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260629T234149Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260629T234149Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
